// VALIDATION: Standard atmosphere at 11 km (tropopause)
// AREA: Atmosphere
// BASIS: U.S. Standard Atmosphere 1976 published values at 11,000 m
// geopotential altitude: T = 216.65 K, P = 22632 Pa, rho = 0.36392 kg/m^3.
// EXPECT T = 216.65 tol 0.01
// EXPECT P = 22632 tol 5
// EXPECT rho = 0.36392 tol 5e-4
T = isa_T(11000)
P = isa_P(11000)
rho = isa_rho(11000)
